# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Rallee Starter — environment variables template
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy this file to .env (the actual file, no .example suffix) and fill in
# your values. .env is gitignored — your secrets stay local.
#
# Most values are OPTIONAL. The repo works out of the box with NONE of them
# set (you'll just lose access to specific integrations).
#
# Dave will pre-fill the ones Just Sorted manages and share via 1Password.
# The rest you connect at your own pace.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ─── Anthropic ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Only needed if you use embeddings-based vault search.
# Without it, vault_search.py falls back to ripgrep keyword search.
# Get your own at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=


# ─── Google Workspace (Gmail / Calendar / Drive) ──────────────────────────
# Recommended: skip these. Connect Gmail / Calendar / Drive via Claude Code's
# built-in MCP settings — your tokens never touch this file.
#
# Only fill in below if you want to use the custom Python tools instead.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN=


# ─── Canva ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Recommended path: claude.ai → Settings → Connectors → Canva (no env needed).
# Only fill below if you set up the Canva MCP server in Claude Code (advanced).
# See https://www.canva.dev/docs/connect/mcp-server/
CANVA_API_TOKEN=


# ─── Telegram (optional, for mobile alerts) ───────────────────────────────
# Create a bot via @BotFather, paste the token below.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=


# ─── Klaviyo (optional, email marketing) ──────────────────────────────────
KLAVIYO_API_KEY=


# ─── LinkedIn (optional, advanced) ────────────────────────────────────────
LINKEDIN_SESSION_COOKIE=


# ─── GitHub (optional — gh CLI handles this for you) ──────────────────────
GITHUB_TOKEN=


# ─── Workspace paths ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
VAULT_PATH=.
